                                                "sense_id": "bfc70df7-7253-3e8b-9a94-15ea578f6ae6",
                                                "text": "Set against the background of the American civil war, with Keaton a cunning but unskilled driver, unaided, of the ponderous giant of a locomotive, it remains not only probably the funniest film about railways ever made, but one of the funniest silent films to retain its comic power over today's more sophisticated audiences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94ef18b9-2065-4f05-925a-3b86b7c37d18",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc70df7-7253-3e8b-9a94-15ea578f6ae6",
                                                "text": "Lewis Stone as the Marquis gives one of the greatest performances in silent film I have ever seen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6958b13-26cf-4a1e-b2ff-e951ced0ca28",
                        "source_entry_id": "d02bc0d3-05b6-3342-978a-9bbb62cfb67d",
                        "source_sense_id": "05b023c0-93a7-3550-97f8-705d176953e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Film ohne aufgezeichneten Ton, bei dem der zusammengefasste Dialog auf Texttafeln eingeblendet wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "silent picture",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silent picture",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7a9969e-fe01-3172-b36c-88bca53a9c61",
                                        "entry_id": "e8d9ee59-6fe7-3b6b-8b47-299c336e577d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of silent film."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77595f89-a2e0-453f-86c7-211d34948ce2",
                                                "sense_id": "e7a9969e-fe01-3172-b36c-88bca53a9c61",
                                                "text": "In these early days of silent pictures, the accent was chiefly on thrills and danger as provided by supposedly unstoppable locomotives with crooks or maniacs on the footplate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e0b47a5-a531-4ae8-b9e2-8d00686fb505",
                        "source_entry_id": "d02bc0d3-05b6-3342-978a-9bbb62cfb67d",
                        "source_sense_id": "05b023c0-93a7-3550-97f8-705d176953e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Film ohne aufgezeichneten Ton, bei dem der zusammengefasste Dialog auf Texttafeln eingeblendet wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "cinéma muet",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cinéma muet",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78318b54-5622-3e1d-b226-b6be952280f6",
                                        "entry_id": "f785dcfb-0886-39fe-87e9-783e92e7cbd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cinéma sans paroles, dont la bande-son est inexistante, ou dont la bande-son n’est constituée que de musique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "394de7a8-c050-4033-bc69-9243042c92fc",
                                                "sense_id": "78318b54-5622-3e1d-b226-b6be952280f6",
                                                "text": "Ah ! Le dialogue des regards ! L’éloquence du cinéma muet. Rien n’est plus fort que le mutisme lorsqu’on a quelque chose d’important à se dire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a36a812-218f-430b-9d82-ba72fea48b3b",
                                                "sense_id": "78318b54-5622-3e1d-b226-b6be952280f6",
                                                "text": "François Jost a défendu de manière convaincante la thèse selon laquelle le cinéma muet avait une grande facilité à insérer des images qui étaient la visualisation des pensées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
